  "brief": {
    "zh": "取回深水码头和高架步道的票券，从东北灯塔离开。蓝潮炮每 3 回合扫过西栈桥。白潮炮每 4 回合扫过中栈桥，红潮炮每 5 回合扫过东栈桥。中央快桥和南北长堤都能过潮线。限 57 回合。",
    "en": "Collect the tickets from the deep-water dock and the raised boardwalk, then leave at the northeast lighthouse. The west tidal pulse fires every 3 turns. The middle pulse fires every 4 turns and the east pulse every 5. Both the short crossing and the long boardwalks cross the tide lanes. You have 57 turns."
  },
